Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '; taskctl add 'Ship v0.5.0' --due tomorrow >/dev/null; taskctl add 'Write release notes' >/dev/null; taskctl add 'Reply to support mail' >/dev/null; clear"
Enter
Show
Type "taskctl"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Space
Sleep 1500ms
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
